data enrollment_discovery_receipt_unbound_contract_note: String = "Phase 0A honesty: contracts with consumer_witness: NoConsumerWitness remain enrolled in lens_contract_registry and are enumerable via lens_contract_is_unbound (v2.lens.enforcement.receipts, routed through consumer_enrolled_for — not a parallel coproduct Bool predicate), but coverage_receipts_live does not derive an EnrollmentDiscoveryReceipt for them — semantic receipt legs (scope, subjects, red control, self-application) would be fabricated without a bound consumer witness. Unbound contracts stay visible and countable for the coming inventory phase; omitting receipts is not omitting contracts."
